    "CSV is for exchanging income lines. The full JSON backup also includes notes, project icons, month reviews, and settings; it is merge-only and does not replay sync deletes. Safety snapshots are written automatically before the local ledger is emptied." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
